ary","noteId":"n1907"},{"text":"[^n1908]: Matt. xviii. 11.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1908"},{"text":"[^n1909]: John vii. 1.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1909"},{"text":"[^n1910]: Luke xiii. 1.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1910"},{"text":"[^n1911]: Luke xiii. 2.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1911"},{"text":"[^n1912]: Luke xiii. 3.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1912"},{"text":"[^n1913]: Borg. ms. omits now.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1913"},{"text":"[^n1914]: Luke xiii. 4.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1914"},{"text":"[^n1915]: See note, § 10, 13.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1915"},{"text":"[^n1916]: Luke xiii. 5.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1916"},{"text":"[^n1917]: Luke xiii. 6.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1917"},{"text":"[^n1918]: Luke xiii. 7.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1918"},{"text":"[^n1919]: Luke xiii. 8.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1919"},{"text":"[^n1920]: Luke xiii. 9.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1920"},{"text":"[^n1921]: Luke xiii. 10.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1921"},{"text":"[^n1922]: Luke xiii. 11.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1922"},{"text":"[^n1923]: Luke xiii. 12.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1923"},{"text":"[^n1924]: Luke xiii. 13.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1924"},{"text":"[^n1925]: Luke xiii. 14.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1925"},{"text":"[^n1926]: Lit. great (man).","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1926"},{"text":"[^n1927]: Luke xiii. 15.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1927"},{"text":"[^n1928]: Luke xiii. 16.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1928"},{"text":"[^n1929]: Lit. calumniator.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1929"},{"text":"[^n1930]: Luke xiii. 17.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1930"},{"text":"[^n1931]: cf. Syriac versions.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"n1931"},{"text":"[^n1932]: On margin of Vat. ms., in another hand: “This is the beginning of the second part of Diatessaron, which means The Four.” See p. 467 of Ciasca’s Essay, mentioned above (Introduction, 5).","kind